#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:81
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_WelcomeToDevonCorp"
msgid ""
"Hello and welcome to the DEVON\n"
"CORPORATION.\p"
"We're proud producers of items and\n"
"medicine that enhance your life.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_StaffGotRobbed"
msgid ""
"One of our research staff stupidly\n"
"got robbed of an important parcel.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:91
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_ThoseShoesAreOurProduct"
msgid ""
"Hey, those RUNNING SHOES!\n"
"They're one of our products!\p"
"It makes me happy when I see someone\n"
"using something we made.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:97
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_RobberWasntVeryBright"
msgid ""
"That stolen parcel…\p"
"Well, sure it's important, but it's not\n"
"anything that anyone can use.\p"
"In my estimation, that robber must not\n"
"have been very bright.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:104
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_SoundsLikeStolenGoodsRecovered"
msgid ""
"It sounds like they've recovered\n"
"the ripped-off DEVON GOODS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_OnlyAuthorizedPeopleEnter"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, only authorized people\n"
"are allowed to enter here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:112
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_HowCouldWeGetRobbed"
msgid ""
"It's beyond stupid.\n"
"How could we get robbed?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_YoureAlwaysWelcomeHere"
msgid ""
"Hi, there!\n"
"You're always welcome here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_RocksMetalDisplay"
msgid ""
"Samples of rocks and metal are\n"
"displayed in the glass case.\p"
"There's a panel with some writing\n"
"on it…\p"
"“DEVON CORPORATION got its start as\n"
"a producer of stones from quarries.\p"
"“The company also produced iron from\n"
"filings in the sand.\p"
"“From that humble start as a producer\n"
"of raw materials, DEVON developed.\p"
"“DEVON is now a manufacturer of a wide\n"
"range of industrial products.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F/scripts.inc:134
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_1F_Text_ProductDisplay"
msgid ""
"Prototypes and test products fill\n"
"the glass display case.\p"
"There's a panel with a description…\p"
"“In addition to industrial products,\n"
"DEVON now markets sundries and\l"
"pharmaceuticals for better lifestyles.\p"
"“Recently, DEVON has begun marketing\n"
"tools for POKéMON TRAINERS, including\l"
"POKé BALLS and POKéNAV systems.”$"
msgstr ""
